{title: Saat Samundar Paar Mai Tere}
{artist: Sadhana Sargam}
{key: G#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[G#m]Saat samundar [F#]paar main tere
[D#m]peechhe peechhe [G#m]aa gai
[G#m]zulmi meri jaan ...
[G#m]o zulmi [F#]meri jaan tere
[E]kadamon ke [F#]neeche aa gai
[G#m]saat samundar....
[G#m]Na rasta [F#]maaloom na
[F#]tera [G#m]maan-pata maaloom
[F#]kaise mere pyaar ne tujhako
[G#m]dhoondha kya maaloom
[G#m]seedhi tere paas ...
[G#m]seedhi tere [F#]paas main
[E]ankhiyaan meeche [F#]meeche a gai
[G#m]saat samundar....
[G#m]Mainne teri [F#]yaadon ke
[F#]zulfon mein [G#m]lagaaye phool
[F#]aage teri marzi tu kar
[G#m]na kar mujhe kabool
[G#m]chhod ke main apane
[G#m]chhod ke [F#]main apane
[E]baabal ke [F#]baag-bageeche a gai
[G#m]saat samundar....
